  "description": "Death is usually the end, but for Erik, it’s just the beginning. Though he can’t remember anything before he died, he remembers that he wants revenge and a reason why he was killed. Together with Moll, the mysterious girl who brought him back, the two embark on a journey to find out who they are and what circumstances put them in their current predicament. \n\n(Source: Manta)",
